  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-esmfold-P62894-esmatlas-run> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ESMFold prediction run for Cytochrome c from Bos taurus (P62894), with its input and output checksums" .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-esmfold-P62894-esmatlas-run> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Input: UniProt P62894, sequence version 2, residues 1-105, 105 aa; the vendored record is organism-design/esmfold/inputs/P62894.json (SHA-256 355e3bee19ff26f7d8c2832098a8fc77b31cbc0cfb676a463af069da5a51c7ed) and the sequence SHA-256 is dccf7c36b9335812c610cf20e0bae80dd2ee16b9e66b6c0f9f77406ebd58fcac. Call: POST to https://api.esmatlas.com/foldSequence/v1/pdb/ on 2026-10-31T06:41:12.080Z, HTTP 200, 0.1 s. The service reports its own version as \"ESMFOLD V1 PREDICTION FOR INPUT (PDB TITLE record)\". Output: one predicted structure, 105 residues modelled, written to P62894-esmatlas/predicted.pdb (SHA-256 ee513a03049ebaa37f6761bae5310c448df274b8813bd9a34e0454d05de1db24). Every pLDDT number below was read from the B-factor column of that file; the file carries the scale \"0-1, multiplied by 100 here\". Mean 92.41, minimum 73, maximum 96, fraction at or above 70 is 1, fraction at or above 90 is 0.79. The run record is organism-design/esmfold/runs/P62894-esmatlas/result.json (SHA-256 6ef738e750e21626145180b2432ed5c38ba661298100e333acef6e979ec5d06f)." .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-esmfold-P62894-esmatlas-run> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "organism-design/esmfold/runs/P62894-esmatlas/result.json" .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-esmfold-P62894-esmatlas-run> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "sha256:6ef738e750e21626145180b2432ed5c38ba661298100e333acef6e979ec5d06f" .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-esmfold-P62894-esmatlas-run> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> <https://www.uniprot.org/uniprotkb/P62894> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-esmfold-P62894-esmatlas-run> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://api.esmatlas.com/foldSequence/v1/pdb/> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-esmfold-P62894-esmatlas-run> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://esmatlas.com/about#api> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-esmfold-P62894-esmatlas-run> <https://schema.org/codeRepository> <https://github.com/fractastical/delphi> .
}
